plugins.description:
{{quote}} -> reply to a text message. I turn it into a historical-quote style image, with the sender's profile photo.

{{brat}} -> reply to a text or send it with the command ({{brat my cool text}}). Turns the text into a brat-style image.

{{classico}} -> reply to or send a video/photo/gif/sticker, with two phrases separated by `/`: one goes above and the other below the image. Example: {{classico top text / bottom text}}

{{simples}} -> reply to an image/photo/gif/sticker with a single phrase that goes on top. Example: {{simples when they put a meme inside a many tutorial}}

{{desmot}} -> reply to or send a video/photo/gif/sticker, with a title and caption separated by `/`. Generates a demotivational-poster style image: black frame, framed image and text below. Example: {{desmot WHAT / my caption here}}

{{papa}} -> generates the pope holding a photo meme. Three ways to use it:
- {{papa}} alone: uses your own profile photo
- {{papa @person}} or replying to someone's text message: uses that person's profile photo
- Replying to an image or sending an image with {{papa}} as the caption: uses the image provided
